# Tests for the stock module of the stage0 sample `inventory`.

stockTest is test
stockTest purpose "Restocking 5 then 3 nails and taking 2 leaves 6; taking a missing item gives -1"
stockTest verifies restock adds
stockTest verifies take takes
stockTest typeParameter none
stockTest input none
stockTest output none
stockTest outputOwnedBy none
stockTest raises none
stockTest effect none
stockTest uses none
stockTest memoryHeap true
stockTest async false
stockTest maxRecursion none
stockTest label begin loopKind none
stockTest label begin within none
stockTest let nails String "nails" immutable
stockTest let five Int64 5 immutable
stockTest let three Int64 3 immutable
stockTest let two Int64 2 immutable
stockTest let six Int64 6 immutable
stockTest let tape String "tape" immutable
stockTest let minusOne Int64 -1 immutable
stockTest at begin do makeCounts
stockTest at begin do r1
stockTest at begin do r2
stockTest at begin do t1
stockTest at begin do expectLeft
stockTest at begin do t2
stockTest at begin do expectNone
stockTest at begin return ok none

store is region
store in stockTest
store strategy arena
store maxBytes 65536
store released atReturn

makeCounts is call
makeCounts in stockTest
makeCounts invokes Counts.new
makeCounts argument region Region store lend
makeCounts result counts Counts
makeCounts ownedBy store
makeCounts cleanedBy none
makeCounts borrows none
makeCounts catch none
makeCounts suppresses none

r1 is call
r1 in stockTest
r1 invokes restock
r1 argument counts Counts counts lendMutable
r1 argument name String nails lend
r1 argument amount Int64 five copy
r1 result none
r1 ownedBy none
r1 cleanedBy none
r1 borrows none
r1 catch none
r1 suppresses none

r2 is call
r2 in stockTest
r2 invokes restock
r2 argument counts Counts counts lendMutable
r2 argument name String nails lend
r2 argument amount Int64 three copy
r2 result none
r2 ownedBy none
r2 cleanedBy none
r2 borrows none
r2 catch none
r2 suppresses none

t1 is call
t1 in stockTest
t1 invokes take
t1 argument counts Counts counts lendMutable
t1 argument name String nails lend
t1 argument amount Int64 two copy
t1 result left Int64
t1 ownedBy none
t1 cleanedBy none
t1 borrows none
t1 catch none
t1 suppresses none

expectLeft is call
expectLeft in stockTest
expectLeft invokes test.assertEqualInt64
expectLeft argument expected Int64 six copy
expectLeft argument actual Int64 left copy
expectLeft result none
expectLeft ownedBy none
expectLeft cleanedBy none
expectLeft borrows none
expectLeft catch none
expectLeft suppresses none

t2 is call
t2 in stockTest
t2 invokes take
t2 argument counts Counts counts lendMutable
t2 argument name String tape lend
t2 argument amount Int64 two copy
t2 result none2 Int64
t2 ownedBy none
t2 cleanedBy none
t2 borrows none
t2 catch none
t2 suppresses none

expectNone is call
expectNone in stockTest
expectNone invokes test.assertEqualInt64
expectNone argument expected Int64 minusOne copy
expectNone argument actual Int64 none2 copy
expectNone result none
expectNone ownedBy none
expectNone cleanedBy none
expectNone borrows none
expectNone catch none
expectNone suppresses none
